>
> This is encouraging.  Learning perl regular expressions I can get the function to do what I need in this specific case but best option would be if there is a way to change the file format or some such trick that will help me upload my sessions to github (can I save the file with specific extension that allows me to view the file upload to github with rawgit <https://rawgit.com/>).  What I am thinking with rawgit is that if can view the proper output in Linux with '>cat output' maybe it can be rendered into the correct format for rawgit to know how to render it correctly.  Thanks again.
