 This question has nothing to do with R and so it's a bit confusing. That said if I were you I would try to use history and not script. Then, you can edit by hand  the history of your bash commands to be  a minimal script  that you want to use. Script seems to be a way to  record a whole session  ( both input and output) which I don't think is what you want to do.

